    "overview": "Waterline makes agricultural input finance readable through a deep teal navigation band, a pale blue ground, and white working surfaces. Compact typography and clearly separated records support repeated operational work. Color locates available credit, reservations, payments, and exceptions; outline icons identify actions and transaction stages.\n\nThe system is calm, practical, and explicit about evidence. Amounts, state labels, and the next permitted action carry the hierarchy. Mode disclosures remain part of the interface: simulated records, PayPal sandbox verification, and unavailable upstream evidence retain their distinct meanings. There are no shipping raster assets; diagrams are rendered from scoped application data.",
